Package: distroclone-backup
Version: 1.4.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: yad, rsync, pkexec, util-linux, cron
Recommends: distroclone, btrfs-progs, snapper, libnotify-bin
Maintainer: Franco Conidi aka edmond <fconidi@gmail.com>
Description: DistroClone Backup & Restore Tool
 Incremental rootfs backup and restore tool for Debian-based systems.
 Companion tool for DistroClone.
 .
 Runs through polkit; no passwordless sudo rules are installed. The cache
 is checked before a restore and other mounted filesystems are never
 touched. On btrfs cache filesystems, versioning is managed through a
 dedicated snapper config ("distroclone-backup"); other filesystems use
 plain rsync without versioning.
 .
 Supports: English, Italiano, Deutsch, Français, Español, Русский.
